# HP40gs stock launch through the original APLET UI and serial disk.
# HP40gs boots into the CAS front end more slowly than HP39gs, so wait for
# initialization before entering APLET LIBRARY.
2000 tap f6
4000 tap f6
13000 tap home
15000 tap aplet
16000 capture aplet-library
17000 tap f5
18000 capture receive-menu

# HP40gs 2.22 RECEIVE FROM order has no HP39 (IrDA) entry:
#   HP39/40 (USB), HP39/40 (Ser), USB Disk drive, Ser. Disk drive.
18500 tap down
19200 tap down
19900 tap down
20200 capture receive-serial-disk
20600 tap enter

# Directory metadata loads first; ENTER then lazily installs the selected aplet
# and library. The exact transfer duration varies because stock Kermit retries.
40000 capture remote-aplet
41500 tap enter
43000 capture lazy-fetch
190000 tap enter
200000 tap enter
210000 tap enter
220000 tap enter
230000 tap enter
240000 tap enter
43500 monitor 205000
